{"id":"633337","name":"红糖馒头","author":"どら","authorId":"10454906","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633337/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红糖水","amount":"260克"},{"name":"低粉","amount":"500克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"5克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"温的红糖水260克放入5克酵母粉搅拌均匀。","img":"images/633337/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入500克低粉搅拌成絮状。","img":"images/633337/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/633337/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盖锅盖发酵。","img":"images/633337/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/633337/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"揉成光滑面团，放入纸托。","img":"images/633337/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"在发酵两倍大。","img":"images/633337/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大火蒸20分钟，焖5分钟。","img":"images/633337/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/633337/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/633337/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}